    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Life of a Magical Circle is a deceptively simple evade-and-collect game. Take control of a circular creature and see if you can figure out your purpose with only a little help from a mysterious narrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control a magical, creature-like circle with nothing more than the fluid movement of your mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dodge increasingly difficult obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Eat up smaller circles that will either help you fulfill your purpose, or distract you and change the gameplay in strange and amusing ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A curious and philosophical narrator will observe you, react to your choices, reflect upon his own life, and wonder aloud about the nature of chasing one's dreams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gaze upon a beautiful, evolving, fractal-based background</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Listen to a wonderful soundtrack that you contribute to musically through your actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30 minutes to 3+ hours long depending on your skill level, how wise you are, and how much you want to see</p>",
